### Essential Commands

```bash
# Build and run
go build ./...
go run ./cmd/myapp

# Testing
go test ./...
go test -race ./...
go test -cover ./...

# Static analysis
go vet ./...
staticcheck ./...
golangci-lint run

# Module management
go mod tidy
go mod verify

# Formatting
gofmt -w .
goimports -w .
```

### Recommended Linter Configuration (.golangci.yml)

```yaml
linters:
  enable:
    - errcheck
    - gosimple
    - govet
    - ineffassign
    - staticcheck
    - unused
    - gofmt
    - goimports
    - misspell
    - unconvert
